<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>What Domain Will Your Accelerated Simulations Focus On?</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/output.css">
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-slate-950 text-slate-100">
    <%- include("../backButton") %>

    <main class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-8 sm:px-8 sm:py-12">
        <header class="mb-10">
            <p class="mb-2 text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-400">
                Accelerated Simulations
            </p>

            <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">
                What domain will your accelerated simulations focus on?
            </h1>

            <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-slate-300">
                Choose the complex systems your AI will simulate and explore.
            </p>
        </header>

        <ul class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <li>
                <a
                    href="/social"
                    class="block h-full rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-indigo-400 hover:bg-slate-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-400"
                >
                    <strong class="block text-lg text-white">
                        1. Social &amp; Economic Systems
                    </strong>

                    <span class="mt-2 block text-sm text-slate-300">
                        Simulate economies, cities, institutions, and large-scale human behavior to forecast outcomes and test policies before they touch the real world
                    </span>
                </a>
            </li>

            <li>
                <a
                    href="/biological"
                    class="block h-full rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-indigo-400 hover:bg-slate-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-400"
                >
                    <strong class="block text-lg text-white">
                        2. Biological &amp; Evolutionary Systems
                    </strong>

                    <span class="mt-2 block text-sm text-slate-300">
                        Run accelerated models of organisms, ecosystems, evolution, and molecular biology to search for new drugs, organisms, or ecological interventions
                    </span>
                </a>
            </li>

            <li>
                <a
                    href="/strategic"
                    class="block h-full rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-indigo-400 hover:bg-slate-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-400"
                >
                    <strong class="block text-lg text-white">
                        3. Strategic &amp; Adversarial Scenarios
                    </strong>

                    <span class="mt-2 block text-sm text-slate-300">
                        Continuously simulate competition, conflict, negotiation, and game-theoretic situations to explore every plausible move and countermove
                    </span>
                </a>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
